e, as with a real Kinect. If the game takes your left hand for the right one, set Left and right to Swapped. All of it is estimated from one camera, not measured like a Kinect.","privacy":"Pose processing stays in this browser. The pose model downloads from Google and jsDelivr. Only joint positions go to your PS5 on your network, and a small camera picture if you turn it on.","disconnected":"PS5 not connected.","paired":"Connected. Start the camera to send your movement.","receiving":"PS5 receiving your skeleton.","receiving_lost":"PS5 receiving: no body.","pairing_expired":"Pairing expired. Enter the key shown on the PS5 now and connect again.","ps5_lost":"PS5 connection lost. Reopen the emulator and check the settings-page port.","rejected":"PS5 refused the frame ({0}).","enable_motion":"Turn on Camera motion in the Kinect game's settings on the PS5 first.","renew":"Reconnect the PS5 to renew the session.","console_disconnected":"PS5 disconnected; the pose expires within half a second.","camera_off":"Camera off.","loading_model":"Loading the pose model…","need_https":"The camera needs HTTPS (or localhost on a computer).","body":"Tracking your body.","no_body":"Step back until your whole body is in the picture.","frame_old":"The phone is too slow for this quality; choose Fast.","calibrating":"Stand still facing the camera… {0}%","recentre_in":"Re-centring in {0}… stand still at your spot","tracking":"Kinect mode: {0} m from the camera.","hips_hidden":"Hips out of view: position held. Step back a little.","original":"Original mode: movement relative to your hips only.","demo":"Demo: synthetic body, no camera.","game_bound":"Game: taking the skeleton ({0} frames, {1} with a body).","game_no_skeleton":"Game: camera open, but its skeleton function was not found.","game_no_camera":"Game: no Kinect game has opened the camera yet.","left_punch":"Left punch","right_punch":"Right punch","two_hand_push":"Two-hand push","left_uppercut":"Left uppercut","right_uppercut":"Right 